msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.USERMENUACTIONS.GREENHOUSETEND.TOOLTIP"
msgid "Tended crops grow at full speed and need their fertilizer and water, like a farm tile. Wild crops grow at a quarter of the speed and need nothing, like plants growing in the wild."
